{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>現年38歲女星連詩雅自從榮升人母後，一直積極兼顧家庭與演藝事業。昨日她在社交平台突然上載一張與母親準備開工自拍照，隨即在網上引發巨大迴響。相片中連媽媽驚人真實狀態與兩母女五官對比成為全網焦點。</p>\n<h2>連詩雅罕有公開母女同框自拍照</h2>\n<p>根據連詩雅在限時動態中發布最新相片，她以一身精緻妝容現身工作場地，而身旁正正坐著連媽媽。相中可見兩母女並肩而坐面對鏡頭微笑，連媽媽特意梳起俐落盤髮造型，散發出一股成熟優雅氣質。仔細觀察兩人五官輪廓，無論是眉眼形狀、眼線畫法以至鼻形與微笑角度，彷彿如同複製貼上一般極為相似，整個畫面充斥著強烈視覺衝擊力。</p>\n<h2>社交平台配文交代帶母開工行程</h2>\n<p>面對這張引發熱烈討論合照，連詩雅在社交平台限時動態上親自加上一句簡短留言：「早開工，早收工，今日同媽咪開工。」這句配文直接向外界交代了當日行程安排，證實她這次是特意帶著母親一同參與演藝工作。這次安排讓母親能夠近距離參與女兒日常工作環境，兩人在鏡頭前展現出無比融洽相處狀態。</p>\n<h2>產後極速重返商演與演藝工作軌道</h2>\n<p>回顧連詩雅近年感情與家庭發展，她於2023年與陳家樂正式結為夫妻，並在2024年7月順利誕下愛女陳星頤。自從愛女出生後，她不但迅速恢復產前纖瘦勻稱身型，更火速重返工作崗位積極接拍各類節目及出席商演活動。如今女兒已經2歲大，她目前不時在社交平台分享一家三口溫馨日常，兼顧演藝工作與家庭生活。</p>\n<h2>網民留言洗版大讚連媽媽高貴氣質</h2>\n<p>這張震撼視覺母女合照一經曝光，大批網民隨即在各大討論區及社交平台瘋狂洗版留言。許多人將焦點放在連媽媽身上，紛紛留言大讚「氣質超優雅」以及「高貴大方得體」。另外亦有大量網民對兩母女極高相似度感到震驚，直指「難怪Shiga咁靚，原來遺傳晒媽咪最強基因」，並有不少人留言認為連媽媽雍容華貴氣場不輸身邊女星女兒。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17936147048282916_3032004226ae8637128742.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"CEumBXPa9hT_KYu3hiRsUu2QMSk7ed6hF9MT2RfTE9k.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17936147048282916_3032004226ae8637128742.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Instagram@shi_ga）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361470685464377_14732475986ae8637305f61.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"連詩雅 陳家樂 （圖片來源：Instagram@shi_ga）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361470685464377_14732475986ae8637305f61.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Instagram@shi_ga）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361470821114860_13481506486ae8637460cb2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"連詩雅 陳家樂 （圖片來源：Instagram@shi_ga）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361470821114860_13481506486ae8637460cb2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Instagram@shi_ga）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361470926690469_4065096256ae8637573d2f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"連詩雅 shiga （圖片來源：Ig@shi_ga）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361470926690469_4065096256ae8637573d2f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Ig@shi_ga）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361471021858060_3383183356ae863765f2c2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"連詩雅 shiga （圖片來源：Ig@shi_ga）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361471021858060_3383183356ae863765f2c2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：Ig@shi_ga）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178957270277536661_2299733646aaab65ee814d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"連詩雅 孩子你怎樣長大 雖然湊女勞心勞力，但Shiga甜爆表示老公陳家樂非常重視Work-life balance，兩人會抽空拍拖食飯，享受難得的夫妻專屬時光。（圖片來源：連詩雅IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178957270277536661_2299733646aaab65ee814d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>雖然湊女勞心勞力，但Shiga甜爆表示老公陳家樂非常重視Work-life balance，兩人會抽空拍拖食飯，享受難得的夫妻專屬時光。（圖片來源：連詩雅IG）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T10:42:16.534108+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1146,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T10:18:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T11:38:32.471804+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T10:38:35.182898+00:00","content_hash":"448ac81a549906765fc401ee8571811f30e0d1f8ec7896c018a8752c0d408521","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}